 COMERICA ON APRIL 19, 2021, AND WILL REPORT TO GREG CARR, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, WEALTH MANAGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2021-04-15 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'Costco Wholesale Corporation Announces an Increase in\xa0Its Quarterly Cash Dividend', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., APRIL 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COSTCO COMMON STOCK AND APPROVED A QUARTERLY INCREASE FROM 70 TO 79 CENTS PER SHARE, OR $3.16 ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MAY 14, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 30, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-04-15 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'JK Group Unveils New Initiatives in Sustainability', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., APRIL 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JK GROUP, PART OF DOVER DIGITAL PRINTING\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), ANNOUNCED A NUMBER OF NEW INITIATIVES THAT SUPPORT IMPROVED SUSTAINABILITY.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-04-15 10:12:00-04:56', 'title': 'Duke Energy celebrates the power behind the power on National Lineworker Appreciation Day', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY CELEBRATES THE POWER BEHIND THE POWER ON NATIONAL LINEWORKER APPRECIATION DAY ON APRIL 18.'}{'symbol': 'EA', 'date': '2021-04-15 11:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Feel the Rush and Live the Drama in F1® 2021 – A Next-Gen Experience From Codemasters®', 'text': 'REDWOOD CITY, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, CODEMASTERS® AND ELECTRONIC ARTS INC. (NASDAQ: EA) ANNOUNCED F1® 2021, A NEW NEXT-GENERATION RACING EXPERIENCE LAUNCHING ON FRIDAY JULY 16.'}{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2021-04-15 18:42:00-04:56', 'title': 'Entergy, Holtec and Other Parties File Joint Proposal with NYS Public Service Commission Requesting Approval of Post-Shutdown Transfer of Indian Point', 'text': 'BUCHANAN, N.Y., APRIL 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SUBSIDIARIES OF ENTERGY